stdin	treebank.input
scale	1024
why	the workhorse run (Lon 2026-09-27, CEO-1313): the full input, run ONCE at wall clock, never in a loop; the Snocone demo is the SNOBOL4 demo of the same name transliterated (its ref is byte-identical to demos/snobol4), so it carries the same scale: the treebank family's scale (snobol4 treebank-alloc, sbl 2.03 s at x1024, coo 2026-09-27)
